1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,190
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:02,564 --> 00:00:03,999
Picture two koshari shops

3
00:00:03,999 --> 00:00:05,434
on the same street

4
00:00:05,554 --> 00:00:06,664
Both are clean

5
00:00:06,894 --> 00:00:08,884
The dish meets the specs

6
00:00:09,174 --> 00:00:11,444
The price is exactly as listed

7
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:12,927
But one of them…

8
00:00:13,257 --> 00:00:14,727
has people lining up

9
00:00:15,152 --> 00:00:15,832
Why?

10
00:00:16,752 --> 00:00:19,242
The first shop has quality

11
00:00:19,364 --> 00:00:21,164
It meets the requirements

12
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:23,104
And as ISO puts it:

13
00:00:23,454 --> 00:00:26,094
Quality is the degree of meeting requirements

14
00:00:26,463 --> 00:00:28,533
It's not optional… it's the foundation

15
00:00:28,753 --> 00:00:31,053
The second shop has excellence

16
00:00:31,473 --> 00:00:32,633
It asks the customer

17
00:00:33,023 --> 00:00:34,263
It improves every day

18
00:00:34,593 --> 00:00:35,943
It beats your expectations

19
00:00:36,373 --> 00:00:37,393
before you even ask

20
00:00:37,743 --> 00:00:39,303
Same thing in our work:

21
00:00:39,723 --> 00:00:40,903
A service window that

22
00:00:40,903 --> 00:00:42,083
gets the paperwork right

23
00:00:42,163 --> 00:00:43,013
That's quality

24
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:44,873
A window that measures waiting time

25
00:00:44,873 --> 00:00:46,153
and cuts it every month

26
00:00:46,363 --> 00:00:47,343
That's excellence

27
00:00:47,593 --> 00:00:48,683
So quality

28
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:50,243
is the first step on the ladder

29
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:51,433
and excellence

30
00:00:51,513 --> 00:00:52,853
is to keep climbing

31
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:54,613
Remember it this way:

32
00:00:54,933 --> 00:00:55,993
Quality is a beginning…

33
00:00:55,993 --> 00:00:57,273
and excellence is a journey

34
00:00:57,493 --> 00:00:58,593
What about you?

35
00:00:58,703 --> 00:01:00,303
Is your work stuck at quality?

36
00:01:00,303 --> 00:01:01,433
Or on the journey to excellence?

37
00:01:01,553 --> 00:01:02,883
Tell me in the comments

38
00:01:03,113 --> 00:01:04,223
See you tomorrow…

39
00:01:04,243 --> 00:01:05,343
on Masaa Al-Tamayoz
